  "notes": "88:10-11 «ولو أشركوا» carries «على الفرض والتقدير» (both tafsirs). The identity of «قوما» in 89 is not glossed (Al-Muyassar's «المهاجرين والأنصار» is one view); only «بل مؤمنون بها». No motif on the prophets or the Prophet ﷺ: light for «هدى الله» and «ذكرى للعالمين», a book for «الكتاب». STAGING v4: Kept ambient: 88 is His guidance with a counterfactual (88:10-11, never acted); 89 the prophets of the list; 89:7-10 is a condition; 90 is the Prophet's own conduct (follow their guidance, say...), never shown. Birds crossing on 89:10 and a light swell on 89:13 added (motion check)."
